For the next 14 days on Arena, GPT-Image-2.5 Sunburst by @OpenAI will be available to test directly on Arena!

@OpenAI’s latest image model is ranked #1 in the Text-to-Image Arena, the Image Edit Arena, and in the Multi-Image Edit Arena. Find the link below to Direct Mode, where you can now select GPT-Image-2.5 Sunburst from the dropdown menu.

Access to GPT-Image-2.5 Sunburst ends November 2nd at 8 a.m. PT. Afterward, it will remain available anonymously in Battle and Agent Mode. User votes from Battle and Agent Mode are used to power our real-world leaderboard rankings. In these modes, models are always anonymized.

Entire industries will be built on open models.
Developers need the freedom to build them.

@JensenHuang on why keeping these models open and accessible matters. https://t.co/ib7QYMJdxU
